    "https://recruit.academicpositions.com/?utm_source=academicpositions.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=ap-navbar": {
      "title": "Forward-thinking talent attraction",
      "description": "Forward-thinking talent attraction | Academic Positions Solutions Job advertising Targeted campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Our expertise PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights Solutions Job advertising Targeted campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Our expertise PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights For jobseekers Post a job Forward-thinking talent attraction Attract top academics, researchers, and scientists with Academic Positions. Post a job Success stories Our expertise Recruit academics, researchers, and scientists today Attracting top talent is vital for advancing research and fostering innovation. At Academic Positions, we connect institutions with the brightest minds across all disciplines, understanding the unique demands of academic and scientific recruitment. PhD Recruitment PhD Recruitment Discover the future leaders of research by connecting with brilliant minds eager to start their research journey. Postdoc Recruitment Postdoc Recruitment Fuel innovation with experienced researchers ready to drive impactful discoveries. Industry Recruitment Industry Recruitment Bridge academia and industry by finding scientists who can translate academic knowledge into industry breakthroughs. Faculty Recruitment Faculty Recruitment Build academic excellence by recruiting top-tier faculty dedicated to shaping the next generation of scholars. Academic Leadership Leadership Recruitment Empower visionary leaders who can steer your institution towards academic prominence. Achieve Excellence Take your institution to excellence Investing in attracting top academic talent is crucial for institutions to enhance their research excellence and academic output. Engage your audience Connect with 4 million academics, researchers, and scientists annually through Academic Positions, from recent graduates to experienced scholars. Promote your institution Highlight your institution’s excellence and career opportunities to attract your target audience. Hire top academic talent Leverage their expertise to achieve research excellence and scientific achievements. Book a consultation Success stories Trusted by top universities and research organizations Since 2009, we’ve partnered with over 2,500 institutions, helping them attract top international academic talent. Our proven track record highlights the trust and success in our tailored recruitment solutions. Read success stories \"Our collaboration has been nothing short of transformative.\nFrom the pool of applicants sourced through Academic Positions, we were able to hire 15 highly qualified individuals who are now integral members of our team.” Dr. André Vogel Senior Scientist & Coordinator of the MECS Cluster of Excellence, TU Wien “KTH have used several external channels throughout the years and Academic Positions has proved to generate the most candidates for our academic roles.” Sarah Hydén KTH Royal Institute of Technology “We are extremely happy with the number of highly qualified applicants we received through posting in addition on your website – never previously received so many good candidates in one call.” Stephanie Frequente HR Manager, CSCS – Swiss National Supercomputing Centre “Working with Academic Positions has allowed me to make BIMATEC known within the international community, as well as to evaluate very relevant candidates with the appropriate knowledge. I strongly recommend Academic Positions for those who seek for qualified candidates.” Dr. Fabiola Vilaseca, Principal Investigator Advanced Biomaterials and Nanotechnology (BIMATEC), University of Girona \"Academic Positions is a great way to publish our doctoral vacancies around the world. They are very professional, efficient and flexible. Marga Franco-Casamitjana Universitat Oberta de Catalunya “It is a pleasure doing business with the Academic Positions! EMBL gets great exposure to potential applicants and the service is quick, efficient and friendly.” Matija Grgurinovic EMBL International PhD Programme “We advertised several doctoral positions \nwith a positive response. We received many, very interesting international applications. Certainly, we will keep on using this option to advertise in the future as well.” Dr. Annika Hand M.A. Institute of Philosophy, University of Koblenz-Landau “Advertising at Academic Positions certainly helped getting good applications last time we looked for PhD candidates. Their staff members are helpful and friendly. We will use the services of Academic Positions again.” Prof. Birgir Hrafnkelsson School of Engineering and Natural Sciences, University of Iceland Solutions Forward-thinking talent attraction Tailored academic recruitment marketing and employer branding solutions for aspiring institutions. Job advertising Find your ideal candidate with Academic Positions. Post a job Targeted campaigns Utilize the power of social media to reach your preferred audience. Targeted campaigns Subscriptions Level up your recruiting by becoming a subscription customer. Subscriptions Become a partner Attract top academic talent, inspired by the success of these top recruiters. Solutions Job advertising Campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Recruit top talent PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights Other Candidate Site About us Privacy policy Contact us"
