    "https://www.linkedin.com/company/academic-positions": {
      "title": "Academic Positions",
      "description": "Academic Positions | LinkedIn Skip to main content LinkedIn Top Content People Learning Jobs Games Sign in Join now Academic Positions Staffing and Recruiting Stockholm, Stockholm County 45,262 followers We help research organizations around the world attract top academic talent. Follow View all 43 employees Report this company About us Academic Positions makes attracting top academic talent easy and efficient. We’ve helped more than 2,500 universities and research institutes take their recruitment to the next level since 2009. We assist more than 15,000 academic recruitments annually. Website https://recruit.academicpositions.com/ External link for Academic Positions Industry Staffing and Recruiting Company size 11-50 employees Headquarters Stockholm, Stockholm County Type Privately Held Founded 2009 Specialties Scientific recruitment, Academic jobs, University jobs, Scientific jobs, Research jobs, employer branding, recruitment marketing, and academic recruitment Locations Primary Kungsgatan 35 Stockholm, Stockholm County 11156, SE Get directions Employees at Academic Positions Vincent Ballet Patrik Lodin Tetyana Hud Lesley Walet See all employees Updates Academic Positions 45,262 followers 19h Report this post Ready to take your next step in life-science research? The Doctoral School of the Faculty of Biology and Medicine (FBM) at the University of Lausanne offers PhD Fellowships in Life Sciences starting in April 2027. Pursue your research in a vibrant, internationally connected scientific community in Lausanne. Apply by October 5th! https://buff.ly/paFympy 1 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 1d Report this post NAISS offers up to four Application Expert positions in AI Training for Large Language Models (SELLMA) at Linköping University, Sweden. Work across the LLM lifecycle — from large-scale data management and model training to evaluation, alignment, and tools — using world-class computing infrastructure. Swedish language knowledge is required. Apply by September 17th! https://buff.ly/ZNQKiOY Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 2d Report this post NAISS is recruiting two AI Infrastructure Application Experts for the SELLMA project at Linköping University. Help build the software infrastructure behind large-scale open language models, optimising distributed training, GPU performance, storage and AI workloads on advanced Swedish supercomputers. Apply by September 17th! https://buff.ly/NUISNpu Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 2d Report this post Tampere University invites application for two tenure track faculty positions at Assistant, Associate, or Full Professor level: (1) Electronics and Embedded Systems, and (2) High Voltage Engineering. Build your academic career in Finland within a dynamic research environment bringing together advanced technology, industry, and international collaboration. Apply now! https://buff.ly/UDB3R70 2 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 4d Report this post Are you a highly motivated researcher passionate about deep learning and advancing the frontiers of AI? The Computer Vision Group at the University of Bern is now accepting applications for 2 PhD and 2 postdoctoral positions on cutting-edge, creative projects in deep learning. Join today and contribute to the international research community. Apply by October 1st! https://buff.ly/wk6JJBk 1 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 5d Report this post Interested in pursuing your PhD at one of Europe’s leading ageing research hubs? The Cologne Graduate School of Ageing Research is looking for 12 talented graduates in biology and the life sciences to join their vibrant, fully funded, interdisciplinary PhD programme. Apply by November 3rd! https://buff.ly/8Y0sTjG 3 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 6d Report this post \"Cyber security isn't just a technological issue – it's really a societal issue,\" says Kimmo Halunen, Professor of Cybersecurity at the University of Oulu, whose SafeEarth programme examines the threats facing the satellites that modern life depends on – from hackers and geopolitical conflict to solar flares. His work highlights the value of interdisciplinary research in protecting critical space infrastructure https://buff.ly/AFRqDbs Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 1w Report this post The University of Turku and Åbo Akademi University are recruiting up to 11 postdoctoral researchers in immunology through IMMUFELLOW, an MSCA COFUND programme in Turku, Finland. You design your own three-year project with dedicated mentoring, international training, and a salary of around €4,500 per month. Apply before 19 October 2026! https://buff.ly/PZavxUR 2 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 1w Report this post Looking for a fully-funded international PhD program in life sciences? Find out why the European Molecular Biology Laboratory (EMBL) could be the right place for you! https://buff.ly/bBkbjBd 1 Like Comment Share Academic Positions 45,262 followers 1w Report this post Ready to explore the fundamental properties of condensed matter through doctoral research? The International Max Planck Research School for Condensed Matter Science (IMPRS-CMS) invites outstanding early-career researchers to apply for several fully funded PhD positions. Apply by September 30th! https://buff.ly/rXSSmQD 4 2 Comments Like Comment Share Join now to see what you are missing Find people you know at Academic Positions Browse recommended jobs for you View all updates, news, and articles Join now Similar pages University Positions Advertising Services Research in Germany Research Services Bonn, Nordrhein-Westfalen EURAXESS Education Management Brussels, Brussels PhDScanner Higher Education PhDFinder Advertising Services FindAPhD.com Advertising Services Sheffield, England Fully Funded Scholarships Information Services Lahore, Punajb PhDVacancies Education Administration Programs Manchester, Manchester researchersjob Technology, Information and Internet European Research Council (ERC) Research Services Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, Brussels Show more similar pages Show fewer similar pages Browse jobs Biologist jobs 44,425 open jobs Sustainability Consultant jobs 2,154 open jobs Project Manager jobs 253,048 open jobs Consultant jobs 760,907 open jobs Manager jobs 1,880,925 open jobs Research Analyst jobs 62,874 open jobs Operational Specialist jobs 58,644 open jobs Project Engineer jobs 109,154 open jobs Finance Associate jobs 82,037 open jobs Account Executive jobs 71,457 open jobs PHD jobs 111,034 open jobs Sales Service Representative jobs 138,869 open jobs Biochemist jobs 33,551 open jobs Analyst jobs 694,057 open jobs Teacher jobs 182,095 open jobs Corporate Sales Representative jobs 1,223 open jobs Sales Manager jobs 310,050 open jobs Category Manager jobs 75,109 open jobs Storage Administrator jobs 23,904 open jobs Financial Assistant jobs 90,005 open jobs Show more jobs like this Show fewer jobs like this More searches More searches Building Engineer jobs Sustainability Consultant jobs Contract Manager jobs Strategy Manager jobs Analyst jobs Buyer jobs Project Manager jobs Professor jobs Associate Professor jobs Language Specialist jobs Financial Assistant jobs Teacher jobs Lecturer of Law jobs Information Specialist jobs Support Manager jobs Assistant Professor jobs Program Coordinator jobs Lecturer jobs Specialist jobs Energy Consultant jobs Statistician jobs Researcher jobs Consultant jobs Manager jobs Data Analyst jobs Engineer jobs Finance Associate jobs Research And Development Engineer jobs Interim Controller jobs Hairstylist jobs Junior Controller jobs Registrar jobs Business Controller jobs Economist jobs Postdoctoral Researcher jobs Management Engineer jobs Student jobs Controller jobs Microbiologist jobs Chemical Engineer jobs Account Manager jobs Marketing Executive jobs Academic Head jobs Creative 