    "https://recruit.academicpositions.com/success-stories/?utm_source=academicpositions.com&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=ap-footer": {
      "title": "What our customers say",
      "description": "Success stories - Academic Positions Solutions Job advertising Targeted campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Our expertise PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights Solutions Job advertising Targeted campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Our expertise PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights For jobseekers Post a job Success stories What our customers say Discover some of the universities and research institutes that we’ve helped attract international academic talent. Success stories Customer testimonials \"Our collaboration has been nothing short of transformative.\nFrom the pool of applicants sourced through Academic Positions, we were able to hire 15 highly qualified individuals who are now integral members of our team.” Dr. André Vogel Senior Scientist & Coordinator of the MECS Cluster of Excellence, TU Wien “KTH have used several external channels throughout the years and Academic Positions has proved to generate the most candidates for our academic roles.” Sarah Hydén KTH Royal Institute of Technology “We are extremely happy with the number of highly qualified applicants we received through posting in addition on your website – never previously received so many good candidates in one call.” Stephanie Frequente HR Manager, CSCS – Swiss National Supercomputing Centre “Working with Academic Positions has allowed me to make BIMATEC known within the international community, as well as to evaluate very relevant candidates with the appropriate knowledge. I strongly recommend Academic Positions for those who seek for qualified candidates.” Dr. Fabiola Vilaseca, Principal Investigator Advanced Biomaterials and Nanotechnology (BIMATEC), University of Girona \"Academic Positions is a great way to publish our doctoral vacancies around the world. They are very professional, efficient and flexible. Marga Franco-Casamitjana Universitat Oberta de Catalunya “It is a pleasure doing business with the Academic Positions! EMBL gets great exposure to potential applicants and the service is quick, efficient and friendly.” Matija Grgurinovic EMBL International PhD Programme “We advertised several doctoral positions \nwith a positive response. We received many, very interesting international applications. Certainly, we will keep on using this option to advertise in the future as well.” Dr. Annika Hand M.A. Institute of Philosophy, University of Koblenz-Landau “Advertising at Academic Positions certainly helped getting good applications last time we looked for PhD candidates. Their staff members are helpful and friendly. We will use the services of Academic Positions again.” Prof. Birgir Hrafnkelsson School of Engineering and Natural Sciences, University of Iceland Success stories Case studies Learn how other institutions have benefitted by leveraging the power of Academic Positions academic recruitment and employer branding solutions. Case study 15 PhDs and Postdocs to the MECS Cluster of Excellence MECS aimed to bolster its research team by attracting top PhD and Postdoc talent in their field. To achieve this, they engaged Academic Positions, leveraging our expertise in academic recruitment... June 2024 Case study Attracting Top Scientists and Engineers through Storytelling SRON Netherlands Institute for Space Research, a prestigious space science organization, strived to become a more appealing workplace for international instrument scientists and engineers, with a special emphasis on attracting... June 2023 Become a partner Trusted by top institutions since 2009 Book consultation Book your free consultation today Unlock the potential of your academic institution to attract and retain the finest minds in academia. Begin the transformation of your faculty and research teams, and pave the way for pioneering discoveries and learning. Book a consultation \" * \" indicates required fields Book a consultation Interested in hearing how we can help you and your institution attract top academic talent? Fill in your information below and we’ll get in touch. Full name * First Last Internal ID Internal ID: This field is hidden when viewing the form Internal_Id Email * Phone number Organization * Your role How many people do you expect to hire for academic or research positions in the next 12 months? * This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. Submit Solutions Job advertising Campaigns Subscriptions Employer branding Recruit top talent PhD recruitment Postdoc recruitment Scientist recruitment Faculty recruitment Academic leadership recruitment Success stories Advice & Insights Other Candidate Site About us Privacy policy Contact us Notifications"
